  "description": "Bring bold energy to your creative projects with this neon checkered seamless pattern featuring vibrant pink, yellow, blue, and green colors. The vivid palette combines brilliant rose, chartreuse, han purple, and medium spring green to create an eye-catching checkerboard design full of playful, electric color. This repeating digital pattern is perfect for adding a bright pop of color to backgrounds, stationery, textiles, digital designs, and trendy graphic projects. Whether you’re creating bold summer artwork or fun Y2K-inspired designs, this colorful checker pattern makes every project stand out.\n✨What’s Included:\n• 15 seamless patterns\n• Format: JPEG\n• Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n• High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n• Scrapbooking and junk journals\n• Digital paper and printable backgrounds\n• Fabric prints and textile designs\n• Wrapping paper and gift packaging\n• Planners, notebooks, and stationery\n• Y2K, retro, and pop art projects\n• Party invitations and decorations\n• Stickers, cards, and crafts\n• Social media graphics and digital collages\n• Bold branding and creative DIY projects",
